      "statusChangeID": "62ba7d44b9fdb30bb5e24e96",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "We've examined the Mixcloud domain and have whitelisted it on a trial basis. \nThe whitelist exists only for the root domain `mixcloud.com` and does not apply to any subdomains. From our examination it doesn't appear that the site uses subdomains, but I thought I'd note that just in case.\nJust like with other whitelist entries, we may rescind this whitelisting at any time without notice.\nNotably, the compatibility of video players and our URL resolver with this service was not tested-- we only performed a security analysis of the site.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
