      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Thanks Tupper. I will add for folks trying this out.. It looks like you can't use the live link directly...\nEg: https://www.mixcloud.com/live/GlamourBoyz/\nYou can however fish the master.m3u8 out of the network tab in a browser (F12, network tab, refresh)....\nhttps://live-fsn1-hez.mixcloud.com/hls/10E248A7D114/1656606427/-fIyGSCrzNXT7mHXne9ogQ/81e61075-14f6-42ef-a69f-b2308805636d/master.m3u8\nI tested that one with \"allow untrusted\" and that one will stream without any problems in VRchat. It's a little hacky by works. Considering I get a error in the latest youtube-dl I'm going to say it's a Mixcloud issue and NOT a VRChat problem! \nGreatly appreciate the trial whitelisting!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
