  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "What: To help all the club worlds in VRChat provide whitelisting and playability of live streams from https://www.mixcloud.com/live platform. \nWhy: The DMCA horrors of dj twitches can end since we will have something else that is supported in VRChat that is legit.\nMixcloud is a licensed service which has agreements in place with many rights holder partners around the world including: major record labels, independent record labels, publishers, distributors, performance rights organisations, collective management organisations, and more.",
